000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID. TRQPUPDT.
000400 AUTHOR. KURT MOVSESIAN.
000500*REMARKS.
000600*
000700**************************************************************
000800*                                                            *
000900*   T R Q P U P D T                                  BR1     *
001000*D   THIS PROGRAM ALLOWS PURCHASING TO PUT A REQUISITION     *
001100*D   ON HOLD USING ANY VALID HOLD STATUS OR RETURN A         *
001200*D   REQUISITION. NOTE THE REQUISITION MUST BE RELEASED      *
001300*D   BY THE ORIGINATOR AND THE REQUISITION CANNOT BE ON A    *
001400*D   P.O. BEFORE A REQ. CAN BE PUT ON HOLD OR RETURNED.      *
001500*D   THIS PROGRAM IS ALSO USED BY PURCHASING TO ASSIGN       *
001600*D   BUYER CODES TO REQUISITIONS                             *
001700*                                                            *  S
001800*   SUBROUTINES CALLED:                                      *
001900*                           1) SRQPUPDC.SOURCE               *
002000*                           2) SRQPUPDN.SOURCE               *
002100*                           3) TCHKBLKT.SOURCE               *
002200*                           4) TBLKTINQ.SOURCE               *
002300*                                                            *
002400**************************************************************
002500*
002600*
002700*       INPUT.
002800*         1. STORES DATA BASE
002900*       OUTPUT.
003000*         1. TERMINAL SCREEN.
003100*
003200*      ON DEC. 15,1982.
003300*       1. ADDED CLASS, AVG MTH ISSUE, LAST ISSUE DATE,
003400*          ISSUE DEPT TO THE UPDATE SCREEN.
003500*              KURT MOVSESIAN.
003600*
003700*        JAN 23, 1984
003800*          1. CHANGE THE 'YEAR-TO-DATE' CALCULATION OF USAGE TO
003900*             'LAST-12-MONTHS' TO CORRESPOND TO MATERIAL STATUS
004000*             INQUIRY AND REQUISITION UPDATE.
004100*                 KURT MOVSESIAN.
004200*
004300*    APRIL 27, 1985
004400*      1. CONVERTED TO VIEW/3000.
004500*      2. CALL TDATECHK TO HANDLE DATES.
004600*      3. BROKE THE REQUISITION UPDATE SCREEN FOR CODED INTO
004700*         A SUBROUTINE 'SRQPUPDC'. THIS ROUTINE HANDLES ALL CODED
004800*         REQUISITION. ADDED LOGIC TO CALL A SUBROUTINE FOR NON-
004900*         CODED THAT IS COMMENTED OUT UNTIL THE PROGRAM IS
005000*         WRITTEN.
005100*      4. EXPANDED THE REQ. NUMBER FIELD TO 12 DIGITS AND TOOK
005200*         OUT LOGIC FOR THE 'A' PREFIX REQ. NO. SINCE THE 'A' IS
005300*         NO LONGER USED.
005400*      5. ADDED THE REQUIREMENT INQUIRY SUBROUTINE 'TBLKTINQ' TO
005500*         BE CALLED BY 'SRQPUPDC'. THIS IS THE SAME INQUIREY
005600*         MATERIAL STATUS CALLS.
005700*            KURT MOVSESIAN.
005800*
005900*   10/21/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND
006000*             CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE
006100*             LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND
006200*             ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.
006300*   10/21/85  CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF TSCRPRNT TO TSCRPRT2,
006400*             TDATECHK TO TDATECK2.
006500*             THIS WAS TO INCORPORATE THE NATIVE LANGUAGE
006600*             SUPPORT VERSIONS OF THESE SUBROUTINES.
006700*                             -TW COTTON.
006800*
006900*    02/08/86.
007000*      ADDED THE CALL TO "SRQPUPDN" FOR NON-CODED REQ UPDATE,
007100*      AS WELL AS ADDING A LOOP FOR UPDATING ALL REQS FOR
007200*      A CERTAIN WORK ORDER.  CIH.
007300*
      *C   09/11/1996    CA YODER
      *C     RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
007400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
007500 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
007600 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
007700 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZRQPUPDT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MREQ-RQ-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2001
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MBUYER-BY-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0601
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DREQD-WO-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2105
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DREQD-RQ-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
007900
